{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39159","headline":"过旧宅 · 韦庄","name":"过旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华轩不见马萧萧，廷尉门人久寂寥。\n朱槛翠楼爲卜肆，玉栏僊杏作春樵。\n堦前雨落鸳鸯瓦，竹里苔封螮蝀桥。\n莫问此中销歇寺，娟娟红泪滴芭蕉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}